<title>FRANCE: McCann wins Esso ad in 3 new countries.</title>
<headline>McCann wins Esso ad in 3 new countries.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advertising agency McCann Erickson France said on Monday its parent, McCann Erikson, had won the advertising budget for oil company Esso, part of Exxon Corp, in Britain, Argentina and Uruguay.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that McCann Erikson already managed the Esso budget in 52 countries.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the agency said she did not know the value of the new budgets.</p>
</text>
